    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8th Heaven is a Scenario Simulation: a mix between a point &amp; click adventure game and a life simulator. There is sandbox gameplay featuring stats and inventory items, but also a narrative throughline with goals and progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321860/extras/54b72aaca786de960769467a807c5c76.poster.avif?t=1750931240\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321860/extras/54b72aaca786de960769467a807c5c76.webm?t=1750931240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321860/extras/54b72aaca786de960769467a807c5c76.mp4?t=1750931240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You died! Things aren't so bad though, as you find yourself reborn in an island paradise filled with fantastical monster-people. You now have a second chance at life, filled with adventure, relaxation, and romance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SLICE OF LIFE:</strong> an explorable world packed with characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ADVENTURE:</strong> an RPG-inspired combat system that directly incorporates sex!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BARTENDING:</strong> become a barista and make drinks for the islanders!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROMANCE:</strong> nurture intimate relationships with the diverse cast of characters!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321860/extras/cc1663a09bc0d177d4de5989867cfa74.poster.avif?t=1750931240\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321860/extras/cc1663a09bc0d177d4de5989867cfa74.webm?t=1750931240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321860/extras/cc1663a09bc0d177d4de5989867cfa74.mp4?t=1750931240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
